cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the software and the source papers listed in SOURCES.md."
title: "BongTheory: BONG formalizations for quadratic lattices over dyadic local fields"
type: software
version: 0.3.0-rc.1
date-released: 2026-09-01
authors:
  - name: "BONG Theory contributors"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hzldew-git/BongTheory"
url: "https://github.com/hzldew-git/BongTheory"
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - quadratic lattices
  - dyadic local fields
  - BONG
  - formalized mathematics
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of principal results from Constantin N. Beli's
  2003, 2006, 2009/2010, 2019 v2, and 2020 papers on bases of norm
  generators, classification, representation, universality, and integral
  spinor norm groups over dyadic local fields, together with explicitly
  partial extensions for three published papers by Zilong He and coauthors on
  n-universality, classic n-universality, and n-ADC lattices.
